WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.456
The fictional guide says enter hours, rate and separate cost.

00:00:04.456 --> 00:00:11.585
The scenario person understands the purpose but leaves labor hours blank because its requirement is unclear.

00:00:11.585 --> 00:00:15.596
Record this as a simulated response, not external feedback.

00:00:15.596 --> 00:00:28.072
Choose a material correction: label labor hours and hourly rate as required, identify the supplied units and sources, and direct the person to pause if either is missing.

00:00:28.072 --> 00:00:30.745
Separate cost uses the supplied amount.

00:00:30.745 --> 00:00:35.201
Enter zero only after confirming that no separate cost applies.

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:37.429
An unknown amount stays unresolved.

00:00:37.429 --> 00:00:40.994
Explain why this change addresses the blocked calculation.

00:00:40.994 --> 00:00:44.559
Adding decorative pages would leave the problem intact.

00:00:44.559 --> 00:00:53.916
Use the approved AI request to organize possible corrections, then retain the human choice and reject invented praise, figures or sales.
